{"thread":{"threadID":1081,"boardID":13,"topic":"Rats","time":1373987070,"userID":1147,"username":"inCre","lastPostTime":1374869537,"lastPoster":"StepZ","replies":26,"views":1301,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":8261,"threadID":1081,"userID":1147,"username":"inCre","subject":"Rats","time":1373987070,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><strong>Moinsen !<br></strong></p></div><p><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p>Ich wollte mal fragen was ihr von so genannten &quot;<strong>Rats</strong>&quot; Servern haltet. <br>Falls einer nicht weiß was das ist ?! Beispielsweise: <a href=\"http://css.gamebanana.com/maps/21499\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Hier klicken und die Map mal ansehen</a>. <br></p></div><p><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p>Vielleicht spielt ja auch jemand auf solchen Servern ab und zu. Mich interessiert einfach mal was die Community über solche Maps / Server hält.<br></p></div><div class=\"message-align\"><p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Grüße von:</strong></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>InCre aka. Marvin <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span> <br></p></div>","polls":[]},{"postID":8264,"threadID":1081,"userID":42,"username":"The DeagleFreak","subject":"","time":1373990863,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>jaaaaaaaa ich liebe solche maps bitte einfügen bitte bitte</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":8267,"threadID":1081,"userID":1147,"username":"inCre","subject":"","time":1373992041,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wenn sich mehrere Melden, dass sie sowas gut finden, kann man ja mal mit Sky reden ob er nicht eine